+        pool (5x moved value) in Transfer mode; the token then gains ~10%; the whole
+        position returns in Transfer mode. The two legs price the same position at
+        different oracle states, leaving unowned VS residuals:
+          - dst ends with negative VS -> unburnable tail + phantom local claim
+          - src ends with positive VS -> stranded gain, uv pinned at 1.0
+    //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////*/
